---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { canonicalUrl } from '../lib/seo';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About | AI Live Video"
  description="About AI Live Video, a curated editorial directory for AI live video tools and guides."
  canonicalPath="/about/"
  breadcrumbs={[{ name: 'Home', url: canonicalUrl('/') }, { name: 'About' }]}
>
  <article class="container trust-page">
    <header class="trust-page__hero">
      <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
      <h1>AI live video, explained clearly</h1>
      <p>AI Live Video is a curated editorial directory for people researching tools and practical workflows for live video, avatars, translation, and related production.</p>
    </header>

    <section>
      <h2>What we publish</h2>
      <p>We publish tool records, comparisons, and guides intended to help prospective users understand product capabilities and decide what to investigate next.</p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>Who it is for</h2>
      <p>The site is for creators, production teams, businesses, and other readers evaluating AI live video software. It is not a substitute for testing a product or reviewing a provider's current terms.</p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>How to read the site</h2>
      <p>Product information can change. Check the linked official sources and the date shown on a record before making a decision. Read our <a href="/editorial-policy/">editorial policy</a> for the standards behind published content.</p>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .trust-page { padding-bottom: 4rem; } .trust-page__hero { max-width: 48rem; padding-block: 2rem 3rem; } .trust-page__hero > p:last-child { color: var(--color-muted); font-size: 1.125rem; } .trust-page section { max-width: 48rem; margin-top: 1.25rem; padding: 1.5rem; border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--radius-md); background: var(--color-surface); box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft); } .trust-page h2 { font-size: 1.4rem; }
</style>
